# Python-generated files
__pycache__/
*.py[oc]
build/
dist/
wheels/
*.egg-info

# Virtual environments
.venv

# data/ holds BOTH Qdrant's storage (aliases/, collections/, raft_state.json)
# and the corpora. Ignore everything under it, then re-include only the corpus
# that CI and the golden set depend on. Git cannot re-include a file whose
# parent directory is excluded, so each level is un-ignored step by step.
#
# The corpus is committed on purpose: GoldenItem.expected_snippets must exist
# VERBATIM in these documents, so the golden set and the corpus are a matched
# pair. Versioning one without the other is how a typo'd snippet survives
# unnoticed (tests/test_golden.py guards exactly this).
/data/*
!/data/corpora/
/data/corpora/*
!/data/corpora/sample_data1/

/qdrant_storage

/src/scratch.py

*.db

.env